  "body": "**View Wednesday evening 5-6pm**\r\n\r\nLocated in one of Mairangi Bay's most sought-after streets, this beautiful seaside home enjoys sweeping ocean views and an enviable connection to the sea. With the beach just steps away this is true coastal living in a delightfully accessible position.\r\n\r\nDesigned to embrace its spectacular setting, the home offers generous living spaces with effortless connection between indoors and out. Two separate lounges provide room to relax and entertain, with the well-appointed kitchen centrally placed. Expansive entertaining areas open to an ocean-facing deck and a private courtyard, offering distinct spaces to enjoy everything from relaxed family living to gatherings with friends.\r\n\r\nAn invigorating start to the day awaits from your master suite, where sweeping sea views greet you each morning, a gentle sea breeze drifting in, beckoning you to a refreshing swim or leisurely beachside walk. Three further bedrooms, a family bathroom and study ensure all the family's needs are met. Easy everyday comfort and convenience is assured with accommodation and living areas on one level. Adding further versatility and bonus areas beyond what you would expect is a substantial freestanding workshop with loft space-an exciting offering for those with hobbies, creative pursuits, or a need for additional storage or a dedicated teenage retreat. Generous internal garaging, a powder room and a separate laundry add to the home's everyday comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nThe location is every bit as appealing as the home itself. Vibrant Mairangi Bay village is an easy stroll away, with its cafes, shops and uplifting coastal atmosphere. The property is double-zoned for top schooling including Campbells Bay and Mairangi Bay Primary Schools, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College as well as both Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools.\r\n\r\nA prestigious coastal setting, captivating ocean views and the beach just steps away. This is a lifestyle to be treasured. For buyers seeking something special in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal enclaves, this is an opportunity to experience the appeal of Mairangi Bay living at its finest. \r\n\r\nVisit an open home or arrange your private viewing and discover it for yourself.\r\n\r\nFor files on this property paste this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/4P6P",
